<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see a mix of sun and rain.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see a mix of sun and rain.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Thursday were forecast to see a mix of sun and rain, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see showers in the north and central regions with sun in the south and highs of 21 to 24 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see sunny skies in the south, a few showers in the central region with highs of 18 to 24 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see a mix of sun and cloud with showers and highs of 18 to 23 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
